		"Bluetooth pairing button",
		"Octave shift - / +"
	],
	"notice": "Learn and Create editions use the same hardware. Configure MIDI mode, expression and pitch-bend range in ROLI Dashboard to match the destination. Per-note expression requires a compatible instrument; the single-channel notes GUI does not reproduce MPE gestures. Use the supplied MIDI and pedal adapters for DIN MIDI and 6.35 mm pedals. USB port names have not been verified; select this profile manually. Diagram keyboard notes are virtual, starting at MIDI note 48, rather than a statement of factory octave settings.",
